                                  4.
                          T.O.O.L.T.Y.P.E.S

    The tooltypes of the icon


                        LIST_PATH=<Path to TList.txt>
                        COLUMNS=<Number of Columns>
                        EDIT_AXS=<Access Level>
                        ADD_AXS=<Access Level>
                        KILL_AXS=<Access Level>

    If the icon is not found or the tooltypes are commented ';' they
defaults to 255.
